# Turnstile integration is COMPLETE BUT DORMANT (PR #25 owner instruction:
# "Don't add turnstile yet, I will tell you to do it soon").
#
# Nothing is gated today: the worker has no TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY, so health
# reports turnstile:"disabled" and no widget ever mounts.
#
# To enable when the owner says go:
#   1. restore NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY here (the site key is PUBLIC by
#      design — the owner-provided widget key was 0x4AAAAAAE9KeNj44QrpjEW1)
#   2. set the server half on the worker: wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
#      (and allowlist the deployment hostnames in the Turnstile widget settings)
# Health then reports turnstile:"enforced" and the publish forms mount the
# widget automatically — no code change needed.
